# Enables directory listing for this folder and its subfolders
# (admin/, lab/, tech/, dorm/). script.js reads this listing to detect
# photos automatically — see the "Directory-listing" tier in
# loadDynamicPhotos() in script.js, and photos/README.txt for the
# full explanation.
#
# Only relevant on Apache. Nginx doesn't support .htaccess overrides;
# if the site runs on Nginx instead, ask whoever manages the server to
# add "autoindex on;" inside the location block for /photos/ — this
# file alone won't do anything there.
#
# Safe to enable: this folder is only ever meant to hold public photos,
# nothing sensitive.
Options +Indexes

# Keeps the listing minimal/plain so the HTML is small and simple for
# script.js to parse — the styling of this page is never seen by users,
# only read by the fetch() in listFolderPhotos().
IndexOptions FancyIndexing NameWidth=* SuppressDescription SuppressLastModified SuppressSize
